# Manage Iteration (Edda v73)

DSP-04 target is **Cursor**. Iteration protocol lives here — not `CLAUDE.md` (Claude Code ADE). Playbook: `.cursor/playbooks/edda/MIN/`.

Trigger: **"Work on Milestone #N"**

Roles: **TL** (this session) sequences and reviews, writes no feature logic. **dr-dobbs** implements one `feature_execution_graph` node per fresh subagent. **Saga** runs UAT scoped to `feature_file_paths[]`.

Stack: no Django migrate, no Playwright. Gates are pytest / `make test` (`not live_graph`). Saga uses catalogued pytest, not a browser.

---

## Iteration Protocol

1. Locate the manifest by `milestone_number: N` in `docs/plans/iterations/ITER-*.yaml`. Do not pick newest file.
2. Follow MIN-01 → MIN-07. PIN must have published issues and a non-null `milestone_number`.
3. Load context from that manifest + `docs/plans/iterations/pin-orient-*.md` (MIN-02). Do not re-read SAO/features from scratch.
4. Claim the next READY issue (`status-queued` → `status-in-progress`). Respect `parallel_groups` and `conflict_map`.
5. Parse `<!-- FEATURE_EXECUTION_GRAPH -->`. Dispatch a **fresh** dr-dobbs subagent per ready node. Never resume a worker.
6. Worker: fill stubs in `footprint[]` only, run `gate.command` (+ `log_story_command` when declared), commit, post `NODE_PASS` with SHA, **stop**.
7. After all nodes `NODE_PASS`, post `BUILD_COMPLETE` and run MIN-04 (verify BPE-06 node, BPE-07, close with `GATE_PASS`).
8. When the milestone has no open issues: open the iteration PR. Do not merge. MIN-05 Saga UAT on the iteration branch.
9. Blockers → MIN-06 (BPE-09 workers + Saga regression). CLEAN → MIN-07. Merge and release only on explicit human **"merge"** / **"release"**.

Active: `docs/plans/iterations/ITER-20260905-1654-mail-bridge.yaml` (milestone **#1**). S1–S5 done. S6 #6 TEAM next. S7 queued.

